ExLlamaV3 (https://github.com/turboderp-org/exllamav3) is MIT-licensed.
This workstream vendors no ExLlamaV3 sources. The vLLM plugin talks to a
pinned `exllamav3_ext` build. Keep the conversion environment and the vLLM
runtime environment separate.

Dense EXL3 vLLM glue is adapted from the dense subset of
https://github.com/local-inference-lab/vllm/pull/139 (Apache-2.0).
SparkInfer, routed MoE, GLM/DeepSeek, MLA/DCP, MTP, and rank-sliced expert
paths are intentionally not ported.
